      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so basically i'm just breaking them apart so each piece of info only lives in one place. can you give me a concrete example? like say i have an orders table that has order_id, customer_id, customer_name, and customer_address. how exactly would i normalize that into 3NF?",
